{"module":"practice","item":{"id":"a1-practice-17","level":"A1","kind":"fill","title":{"de":"Essen und Trinken 2","bn":"খাবার ও পানীয় ২"},"questions":[{"type":"gap","prompt":"___ Brot ist hier.","answers":["Das"],"options":["Das","Die","Den"],"promptBn":"রুটিটি","explanation":"Brot Neuter: das Brot।","id":"a1-practice-17-q1"},{"type":"gap","prompt":"Ich esse ___ Ei.","answers":["ein"],"options":["ein","eine","einen"],"promptBn":"একটি ডিম","explanation":"das Ei → ein Ei।","id":"a1-practice-17-q2"},{"type":"gap","prompt":"Wir trinken ein ___. (বিয়ার)","answers":["Bier"],"options":["Bier","Brot","Eis"],"promptBn":"বন্ধনীর অর্থ দেখে বেছে নিন","id":"a1-practice-17-q3"},{"type":"gap","prompt":"Ich esse ___. (মাংস)","answers":["Fleisch"],"options":["Fleisch","Gemüse","Obst"],"promptBn":"বন্ধনীর অর্থ দেখে বেছে নিন","id":"a1-practice-17-q4"},{"type":"gap","prompt":"Das ___ ist gut. (সবজি)","answers":["Gemüse"],"options":["Gemüse","Obst","Salz"],"promptBn":"বন্ধনীর অর্থ দেখে বেছে নিন","id":"a1-practice-17-q5"},{"type":"gap","prompt":"Ich habe ein ___ Wasser. (গ্লাস)","answers":["Glas"],"options":["Glas","Messer","Ei"],"promptBn":"বন্ধনীর অর্থ দেখে বেছে নিন","id":"a1-practice-17-q6"},{"type":"gap","prompt":"Das ___ ist teuer. (মুরগি)","answers":["Hähnchen"],"options":["Hähnchen","Brötchen","Getränk"],"promptBn":"বন্ধনীর অর্থ দেখে বেছে নিন","id":"a1-practice-17-q7"},{"type":"gap","prompt":"Ich esse ___ Brötchen.","answers":["ein"],"options":["ein","eine","einen"],"promptBn":"একটি ছোট রুটি","explanation":"das Brötchen → ein Brötchen।","id":"a1-practice-17-q8"},{"type":"gap","prompt":"___ wohnst du? (কোথায়)","answers":["Wo"],"options":["Wo","Was","Woher"],"promptBn":"প্রশ্নবোধক শব্দ","id":"a1-practice-17-q9"},{"type":"gap","prompt":"___ heißt du? (তোমার নাম কী)","answers":["Wie"],"options":["Wie","Wann","Warum"],"promptBn":"নাম জানতে wie","id":"a1-practice-17-q10"},{"type":"gap","prompt":"___ du Kaffee? (trinken, হ্যাঁ/না প্রশ্ন)","answers":["Trinkst"],"options":["Trinkst","Tr